    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> and <math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> are two vectors such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#8901;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>,</mo></math> then <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
